      "headline": "President Lee begins six-day state visit to India and Vietnam, first South Korea-India summit in eight years",
      "summary": "President Lee Jae-myung arrived in New Delhi on April 19 for a three-day state visit \u2014 the first by a South Korean leader to India in over eight years \u2014 aimed at deepening the 'Special Strategic Partnership,' with talks focused on defense, trade, technology, and supply chain cooperation amid the Middle East crisis. Lee is accompanied by a business delegation including chaebol chiefs and is scheduled to proceed to Hanoi for a summit with Vietnamese President To Lam on April 23.",
